      "text": "The United Nations Security Council approves a United States-backed resolution supporting Morocco's autonomy proposal and claim to the disputed Western Sahara, despite opposition from Algeria. ((AP))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Law and crime",
      "text": "A court in Andhra Pradesh, India, sentences five people to death for the November 2015 assassination of the mayor of Chittoor and her husband. ((The Times of India))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Law and crime",
      "text": "A court in Turkey sentences the owner of Kartalkaya hotel to life in prison after finding him guilty of severe negligence in the fire at his hotel in January, which killed 78 people, including 34 children. ((AP))"
